  "description": "Characterized by vibrant colors, bold geometric patterns, and sometimes incorporating mirrors or metallic elements, designed to catch the eye during fast-paced dance movements. Developed as part of Frevo culture, the umbrellas became iconic symbols of the dance form and Pernambuco's Carnival celebrations.",
